   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Nations Industrial Development Organization</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HCFC phase-out management plan (stage II) in Eritrea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eritrea has demonstrated sustained commitment to HPMP stage II, with a 64.2% reduction in HCFC-22 consumption from baseline levels by 2024, supported by a robust regulatory framework and stakeholder training. The second tranche of the plan includes activities focused on enhancing energy efficiency and adoption of low-GWP refrigerants, aligning with decision 89/6 and gender mainstreaming policies. The project underscores continued cooperation between Eritrea, UNEP, and UNIDO to achieve full HCFC phase-out by 2030 in line with Montreal Protocol objectives.</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org role="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Montreal Protocol</narrative>
  </participating-org>
